###

### Follow a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/follow
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

###

### Unfollow a user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/unfollow
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

###

### Get followers of a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/followers?page=1&page_size=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get following of a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/following?page=1&page_size=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
